// A `build.vader` with no `build` fn at all — rejected as H6001.
//
// The check is static: `validate_driver` reads the parsed driver before anything
// is compiled, so this costs no compile. The diagnostic must be anchored on THIS
// file, not on the generated entry the CLI writes to call the driver — a span
// pointing at `vader_build_entry` would name a file the user never wrote.

module "build"

other :: fn() -> void {}
